XC7 qb7 qb6 good q7 qb7 VDD VSS dffr_lv
XC8 qb8 qb7 good to qb8 VDD VSS dffr_lv
XET to pt VDD VSS edgedet
XLAT pt bad lockq lockqb VDD VSS srlatch
XO1 lockq lockn VDD VSS inv_lv
XO2 lockn LOCK VDD VSS inv2x_lv
.ends

